OL,5,G1450 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FLuke and John claim to be the
OL,7,     Funique selling point at Friends
OL,8,     FB&B in Blackpool. But some of
OL,9,     Ftheir guests' feedback leaves a
OL,10,     Fbitter taste.
OL,11,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FFor the third visit, the group
OL,13,     Fhead to The Lincoln Holiday
OL,14,     FRetreat, which Debbie has built
OL,15,     Ffrom the ground up over the past
OL,16,     F20 years. But Carolyn finds the
OL,17,     Fdecor dated.
