OL,5,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FMark and Heidi pride themselves on
OL,7,     Foffering something different in
OL,8,     Ftheir converted chapel - called
OL,9,     FThe Chapel - in Harrogate. But one
OL,10,     Fguest is concerned about her
OL,11,     Ftraditional Chinese bed.
OL,12,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day, and the B&Bers
OL,14,     Fmeet for the last time to settle
OL,15,     Fsome scores. After dramatic
OL,16,     Fdiscoveries and cutting comments,
OL,17,     Fthe payments are revealed and the
OL,18,     Fwinner is announced.
